source_plane run4_institutional_fabric
item_kind proof_frontier
source_ref direction:operator:20261010
note The bar is what the ERPNext-family applications can do, done natively and then exceeded. Frappe is the shorthand for that bar and nothing here depends on it. This is the starting measurement, taken on 2026-10-10 from the compiled inventory in the estate (frappe-surfaces.db) and the command certification matrix (packs/no-simulation/command-evidence-20261010.tsv). A module row is a count read from the inventory. A capability row names the native organ that does the same act and the run that proves it, or says there is none.

