note Capability rows. status is one of: proven (a native organ does the act and a run on real records proved it today), verb_unproven (the organ has the verb and nothing real has gone through it), partial, blocked, absent. Each row was checked against the organ on 2026-10-10; none is taken from documentation.

capability cap:raise-an-invoice
  application_shorthand erpnext Accounts: Sales Invoice
  native_organ bonfyre-pay invoice
  status partial
  evidence receipt rcpt-98a347a32051fb980e2a: 421 metered events of one key in one month invoiced at 295 cents, the meter's own sum
  gap invoices metered usage only; no line items for goods or services, no tax, no customer record, no numbering series

capability cap:record-a-payment
  application_shorthand erpnext Accounts: Payment Entry
  native_organ bonfyre-pay pay
  status verb_unproven
  evidence cmd/BonfyrePay/tests/payment_test.sh: on an invoice raised from the estate's meter, a payment with no reference, a zero amount, an unknown invoice and a repeated reference are each refused, and the invoice is marked paid only when recorded payments reach its amount
  gap the references in that test were written by the test; no payment has been received through the organ, so nothing real has gone through it. Before 2026-10-10 the verb marked an invoice paid with no evidence at all

capability cap:quote
  application_shorthand erpnext Selling: Quotation
  native_organ bonfyre-offer quote
  status verb_unproven
  evidence cmd/BonfyreOffer/tests/quote_test.sh: a review becomes a quoted offer only when a named person states the need, scope, capacity, permissions, price, turnaround and promise; five incomplete quotes are refused, a quote is made once and carries the digest of its review, and bonfyre-distribute composes the stated promise, price and turnaround from it
  gap the terms in that test were written by the test; nobody has been quoted. No line items, no tax, no validity date, no acceptance

capability cap:record-what-work-cost
  application_shorthand erpnext Accounts: Purchase Invoice, Journal Entry (cost side)
  native_organ bonfyre-economy cost record, report
  status proven
  evidence receipt rcpt-bcbfb685c19e14de5573: report accounted for all 406 model costs in the estate's store
  gap costs are per model call; no supplier, no bill, no ledger posting

capability cap:budget
  application_shorthand erpnext Accounts: Budget
  native_organ bonfyre-economy budget
  status verb_unproven
  gap seven budgets are in the store; the verb is not in the certification

capability cap:meter-usage
  application_shorthand none; the applications do not meter their own operations
  native_organ bonfyre-meter record
  status proven
  evidence receipt rcpt-028236e5892f4f6e78bf: one execution recorded with the fabric's own receipt, start time, duration and measured output size
  exceeds every priced event keeps the rate that was admitted when it happened

capability cap:keep-records
  application_shorthand frappe core: DocType create, read, update, delete
  native_organ bonfyre-cms
  status proven
  evidence receipt rcpt-d8cd1c6d43fce5f69b20
  gap certified on a scratch store; the live content store was not exercised by the certification

capability cap:follow-up-with-people
  application_shorthand erpnext CRM: Lead, Opportunity; Communication
  native_organ bonfyre-outreach report; bonfyre-distribute messages
  status partial
  evidence receipts rcpt-7dbba5d549c86c70bc79 and rcpt-98a099d2f31f4aec58f2: 7 outbound entries and 118 composed messages read and counted by state
  gap reading and counting only; a person sends; no lead or opportunity record, no pipeline stages

capability cap:price-list
  application_shorthand erpnext Stock: Item Price, Price List
  native_organ none of its own
  status absent
  gap the services in the finance store under the home directory are experiment prices and are no longer certified on; the 23,954 prices the estate observes belong to other publishers; the estate has no price list of its own

capability cap:projects-and-tasks
  application_shorthand erpnext Projects: Project, Task
  native_organ bonfyre-project
  status proven
  evidence receipt rcpt-716c678f31846de33a97
  gap certified on a scratch space; no timesheet, no billing from tasks

capability cap:telephony
  application_shorthand erpnext Telephony
  native_organ bonfyre-tel
  status partial
  evidence receipt rcpt-b08099fcd606f14db078: a call placed, confirmed by the switch, recorded and hung up in a real FreeSWITCH on loopback
  gap no carrier trunk, so no telephone has rung; send-sms, send-mms and listen have not been run against the switch

capability cap:buying
  application_shorthand erpnext Buying: Request for Quotation, Supplier Quotation
  native_organ the content store, as compiled record types; bonfyre-finance books reads them
  status partial
  evidence on 2026-10-10 the estate held 6 requests for quotation drafted to named vendors and 2 supplier quotations received, 250 and 630 USD; bonfyre-finance books counts them beside the books and posts neither
  gap they are records and nothing acts on them: no comparison of quotes, no purchase order, no receipt of goods, and both quotations are still drafts

capability cap:deals
  application_shorthand crm: Deal; erpnext CRM: Opportunity
  native_organ the content store (9 deals) and bonfyre-finance opportunity rank (9 opportunities)
  status proven
  evidence the finance operator ranked the estate's 9 real opportunities in the certification run of 2026-10-10; expected cost 41,564.00 USD in all, compensation stated for none and shown as unknown
  gap no stage beyond specified; no bid has been received

capability cap:stock-manufacturing-assets
  application_shorthand erpnext Stock, Manufacturing, Assets, Subcontracting
  native_organ none
  status absent

capability cap:people-and-payroll
  application_shorthand hrms HR, Payroll: 160 record types, 53 transactional
  native_organ none
  status absent

capability cap:support-desk
  application_shorthand helpdesk; erpnext Support
  native_organ none
  status absent

capability cap:evidence-on-every-act
  application_shorthand none; the applications keep a document log, not a receipt chain
  native_organ the fabric
  status proven
  evidence 92 operator executions in the matrix each carry an event and a receipt
  exceeds an act that did not happen has no receipt to point at

capability cap:keep-the-books
  application_shorthand erpnext Accounts: General Ledger, Journal Entry, Trial Balance
  native_organ bonfyre-finance books
  status partial
  evidence cmd/BonfyreFinance/tests/books_test.sh: 409 journal lines derived from an invoice, two payments and the estate's 406 model costs; debits equal credits and each figure equals the direct sum of its store
  gap derived, never posted by hand; five fixed accounts; no tax, no period close, no supplier or customer ledgers; the two payments in that run were written by a test

chain chn:commerce-fifteen-stages
  native_organ bonfyre-commerce record, progress, stages
  stages product, listing, inventory, availability_observation, offer, quote, cart, checkout, commitment, payment, settlement, fulfilment, delivery, satisfaction, ownership
  rule a stage requires exactly the one before it; recording a stage establishes that stage and nothing later; nothing in the organ performs a commercial act
  exchanges_recorded 57
  of_which_observed_marketplace_lots 48
  of_which_the_estates_own_opportunities 9
  furthest_stage_any_exchange_has_reached listing (2 of 15)
  measured_from ~/.bonfyre/estate-local/commerce.db on 2026-10-10 after scripts/commerce_adopt_opportunities.sh adopted the nine opportunities whose source is a classified listing
  organs_that_record_into_it bonfyre-offer quote (the quote stage) and bonfyre-pay pay (the payment stage), each refused by the chain when the stage before is missing; on a copy of the chain advanced by a test, both recorded
  reading this chain is the estate's own model of a sale and it goes further than a document workflow, because each stage names who owns it and what it does not establish. Every real exchange stands at the second stage, waiting on a seller's confirmed inventory

summary sum:baseline-20261010
  record_types 1152
  transactional_documents 129
  record_types_tied_to_an_estate_organ 301
  capabilities_listed 18
  proven 6
  partial 5
  verb_unproven 3
  blocked 0
  absent 4
  reading the estate's real commercial work of 2026-10-08 and 09 (deals, requests for quotation, supplier quotations, funding packages, a pledge) is held as records in its content store. The finance organs were measuring experiment figures while that sat beside them; they now read it. What is absent is acting on it: no purchase order, no bid received, no payment, no stock

forbidden_inference a capability listed as proven -> parity with the application's document; the gap line says what is missing
forbidden_inference fifteen rows -> the applications' whole scope; they are the acts checked on 2026-10-10

